":[{"tag":"b","children":["Major Imports:"]}," None\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Galactic Lore"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RESULT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Malachor V is an Outer Rim world that falls within the domain of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"},", and has been a hotly contested world for years.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Prior to the end of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars"},", Malachor V is a fertile and hospitable world. It is an excellent site from which to stage campaigns throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},", making it a tactically valuable planet. After ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars"},", Malachor V is nearly uninhabitable, and visitors to the world face extremely harsh conditions.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["A massive battle renders Malachor V uninhabitable, and thousands of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," are dragged down to the ruined planet's surface. Before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars"},", the planet has several military bases scattered across the world, as well as a Sith Academy.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Malachor V is destroyed by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mass Shadow Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mass_Shadow_Generator"},", a superweapon that eradicates most of the Mandalorian space fleet. Before that fateful battle, the planet changes hands several times, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," constantly urge the Republic to seize the world to prevent further incursions from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
